WEBVTT

00:00:22.210 --> 00:00:26.970
Seeking out a single ray of light,
hito-suji no hikari wo motome

00:00:27.440 --> 00:00:34.210
All I can do is wander on, no matter how far.
hitasura doko made mo tada samayou

00:00:35.790 --> 00:00:42.950
As I breathe a sigh not unlike surrender,
akirame ni nita tameiki wo tsuki-nagara

00:00:43.010 --> 00:00:52.270
I don't want to fear how I've been hurt, all the time.
kizutsuku koto wo osoretaku nai yo itsu mo

00:00:52.410 --> 00:00:54.650
Set me free now!

00:00:54.670 --> 00:01:01.060
Come on, let it all go, to the far reaches of time,
saa tokihanate subete toki no kanata ni

00:01:01.060 --> 00:01:01.080
From that which binds the soul!
tamashii wo shibaru mono wo

00:01:01.080 --> 00:01:06.910
tamashii wo shibaru mono wo
From that which binds the soul!

00:01:06.950 --> 00:01:09.200
For my heartbeat!

00:01:09.210 --> 00:01:11.690
Make freedom your weapon,
jiyuu wo buki ni

00:01:11.690 --> 00:01:11.760
And you are sure to attain it!
kitto te ni ireru no yo

00:01:11.760 --> 00:01:15.470
kitto te ni ireru no yo
And you are sure to attain it!

00:01:15.470 --> 00:01:15.510
The power to believe and dream is there
shinjiru chikara wo yume wo

00:01:15.510 --> 00:01:21.590
shinjiru chikara wo yume wo
The power to believe and dream is there

00:01:21.590 --> 00:01:21.630
for you to go on living.
ikite yuku tame ni

00:01:21.630 --> 00:01:25.960
ikite yuku tame ni
for you to go on living.

00:01:57.570 --> 00:02:01.060
It can't be... why...?

00:02:02.580 --> 00:02:03.600
Yuji!

00:02:06.580 --> 00:02:12.180
Code Number 2805, what are you doing here?

00:02:12.250 --> 00:02:16.150
Apparently, the measures I've taken with you were too lenient.

00:02:39.550 --> 00:02:44.310
2805, disregard the people on the ground! Carry out your duties as a soldier!

00:02:48.550 --> 00:02:50.650
Fire! You will fire!

00:03:53.550 --> 00:04:53.850
Marlene... Marlene...

00:05:02.890 --> 00:05:03.880
Yuji...

00:05:05.560 --> 00:05:11.690
No, it's not possible for me to forget about Yuji...

00:05:36.520 --> 00:05:41.620
I can't pull up any information on Yuji... Why?

00:05:43.530 --> 00:05:45.360
Show me something!

00:05:50.540 --> 00:05:52.800
Yuji!?

00:05:52.870 --> 00:05:56.640
Where are they taking Yuji? Which shuttle number?

00:05:58.540 --> 00:05:59.840
D-36...

00:06:05.550 --> 00:06:10.890
This is impossible! How can there be no arrival record anywhere?

00:07:09.550 --> 00:07:13.990
Seno Miyagi... Director of the Military Station's science section...

00:07:27.900 --> 00:07:31.430
Is it true that 2805 has deserted!?

00:07:31.500 --> 00:07:34.030
Yes, it is believed she is currently aboard a shuttle bus

00:07:34.110 --> 00:07:37.100
headed toward the Military Station.

00:07:37.180 --> 00:07:42.110
2805, are you trying to smear mud on my face?

00:07:42.180 --> 00:07:44.380
Inform Security immediately!

00:07:44.450 --> 00:07:46.440
When she arrives, take her into custody!

00:07:46.520 --> 00:07:47.780
Roger.

00:08:30.900 --> 00:08:36.430
The operation was unsuccessful! 2805 was not on the shuttle!

00:08:36.500 --> 00:08:39.060
Request them to search the Military Station!

00:08:39.140 --> 00:08:40.600
I'm going over there now too!

00:09:22.210 --> 00:09:29.250
0052 through 0078, you take D1-Section. 0083 through 0100 take D3-Section...

00:09:34.160 --> 00:09:38.490
0321 through 0404 search E5-Section...

00:09:41.170 --> 00:09:43.100
Who is in charge here?

00:09:48.510 --> 00:09:51.440
Present location...?

00:09:51.510 --> 00:09:55.240
Education Station Director Amick, we have been expecting you.

00:09:55.310 --> 00:09:59.770
I am Military Station Security Chief Kaidalov.

00:09:59.850 --> 00:10:02.120
So, where is 2805 now?

00:10:02.190 --> 00:10:04.180
We are currently searching her out.

00:10:04.260 --> 00:10:07.450
It is only a matter of time before we find her...

00:10:07.530 --> 00:10:09.460
Underestimate her, and you'll be sorry.

00:10:09.530 --> 00:10:10.550
Director Doug!

00:10:18.200 --> 00:10:21.700
Science section... Autopsy room 205...

00:10:25.540 --> 00:10:32.070
Amick, for her to run away during your re-training, you've really blown it!

00:10:32.180 --> 00:10:34.380
Once the High Council learns about this,

00:10:34.420 --> 00:10:36.080
you're not going to get off without severe punishment!

00:10:36.150 --> 00:10:39.120
The same goes for you!

00:10:39.190 --> 00:10:43.960
Was it not originally your responsibility to oversee 2805?

00:10:45.830 --> 00:10:49.430
Just be sure to catch her before word of this gets out!

00:10:49.500 --> 00:10:54.440
In order to do that, you have to cooperate completely with me!

00:10:54.510 --> 00:10:56.440
I know.

00:10:56.510 --> 00:10:58.440
- Security Chief!
- Ma'am!

00:10:58.510 --> 00:11:00.440
Deploy all personnel to the search!

00:11:00.510 --> 00:11:01.810
Acknowledged!

00:11:13.530 --> 00:11:17.460
Unbelievable! It's trying to completely fuse with the body!

00:11:17.530 --> 00:11:20.660
Its evolution is considerably accelerated.

00:11:55.230 --> 00:11:59.500
Director Seno Miyagi, I would have a little of your time.

00:11:59.570 --> 00:12:01.160
Who are you!?

00:12:01.240 --> 00:12:05.940
Please do your best not to raise your voice. This is not a joke.

00:12:32.870 --> 00:12:37.140
You'll pay for doing something like this! What are you after?

00:12:37.210 --> 00:12:39.470
Where is Kaido Yuji?

00:12:39.540 --> 00:12:41.140
Kaido Yuji?

00:12:41.210 --> 00:12:43.940
The Sleeper who I recovered.

00:12:44.020 --> 00:12:47.140
I know that you're the one who took him away.

00:12:47.220 --> 00:12:49.080
Then you are Marlene Angel?

00:12:52.560 --> 00:12:57.490
Your information was recorded in the associated information for the recovered Sleepers.

00:12:57.560 --> 00:13:02.160
However, your mission is concluded. What do you want now?

00:13:02.230 --> 00:13:06.830
The only thing I want to know is where Yuji is now.

00:13:06.910 --> 00:13:09.500
I cannot tell you that.

00:13:09.570 --> 00:13:12.410
Because it is none of my concern, right?

00:13:24.260 --> 00:13:29.850
Why do you place yourself at this kind of risk to search out a mere Sleeper?

00:13:29.960 --> 00:13:34.490
Is this Sleeper worth that much to you?

00:13:34.530 --> 00:13:37.000
What is Kaido Yuji to you?

00:13:39.540 --> 00:13:47.140
I do not know. But... but, I must find Yuji, no matter what.

00:13:55.550 --> 00:13:58.280
Director Doug! It's just been reported

00:13:58.360 --> 00:14:00.820
that one of the medical staff has lost their ID card!

00:14:00.890 --> 00:14:03.690
ID card... Find out quickly if there's any evidence

00:14:03.760 --> 00:14:06.820
of the card being used since it was lost!

00:14:06.900 --> 00:14:07.690
Acknowledged.

00:14:28.920 --> 00:14:31.450
Present location has been identified!

00:14:31.520 --> 00:14:33.080
So, you've finally found her?

00:14:40.870 --> 00:14:45.130
What is all this detailed genetic data doing in Yuji's file?

00:14:45.200 --> 00:14:47.730
What's happening to Yuji?

00:14:56.880 --> 00:14:57.850
Stay back!

00:15:03.890 --> 00:15:07.480
2805, You are completely surrounded!

00:15:07.560 --> 00:15:10.790
It's in your best interests to surrender quietly!

00:15:15.230 --> 00:15:18.400
Block 38, Laboratory 102...

00:15:35.520 --> 00:15:36.490
After her!

00:16:08.220 --> 00:16:09.310
You're not getting away!

00:16:27.910 --> 00:16:30.500
Put the entire facility on alert!

00:16:30.580 --> 00:16:34.410
Take any measures necessary, but catch her no matter what!

00:17:32.500 --> 00:17:34.770
I- it can't be!

00:17:34.840 --> 00:17:39.440
Invalidation of the lost ID card is complete.

00:17:39.510 --> 00:17:44.110
End of the line, 2805.

00:17:44.180 --> 00:17:48.590
Open up! Open it up! Yuji! Yuji! Yuji!

00:18:10.880 --> 00:18:13.710
You sure put us to a lot of trouble, 2805!

00:18:13.780 --> 00:18:17.440
I will see to it you take full responsibility for this!

00:18:18.880 --> 00:18:23.750
Yuji... Yuji is my friend, who I fought together with...

00:18:25.220 --> 00:18:29.490
It's not possible for me to forget him!

00:18:29.590 --> 00:18:33.290
What nonsense is this!? The Sleepers are nothing more than Samples!

00:18:33.330 --> 00:18:35.770
They are none of your concern!

00:18:35.830 --> 00:18:41.570
No! Yuji is not just a mere Sample! Yuji is different! He's different!

00:18:45.510 --> 00:18:48.210
Take Code Number 2805 in!

00:19:04.860 --> 00:19:06.800
What is the meaning of this!?

00:19:06.870 --> 00:19:10.770
Unknown! The lock has been forced open!

00:19:30.560 --> 00:19:32.750
Yuji is in there...!

00:19:32.820 --> 00:19:38.260
Code Number 2805, this is a restricted area. Withdraw at once.

00:19:41.170 --> 00:19:44.000
If you do not heed my warning, you will be forcibly removed.

00:20:22.210 --> 00:20:26.400
Yuji... What are you doing to Yuji!?

00:20:36.820 --> 00:20:38.810
Yuji!!

00:21:30.420 --> 00:21:39.910
Although the days when we smiled again and again
hohoemi kasaneta hibi ga

00:21:41.270 --> 00:21:46.040
Have passed away into dreams,
maboroshi ni natte mo

00:21:48.250 --> 00:21:55.190
I will surely not lose my way.
watashi wa kitto mayowanai

00:21:55.310 --> 00:22:01.360
To go on to the future,
mirai ni yuku tame ni

00:22:01.510 --> 00:22:07.780
To become an adult,
otona ni naru tame ni

00:22:08.140 --> 00:22:14.970
I again recall now the memories
mogaite kita omoide wo kokoro de

00:22:15.160 --> 00:22:20.130
twisting in my heart.
ima wa kurikaesu

00:22:20.230 --> 00:22:26.190
I'm living in one time,
hitotsu no toki wo iki

00:22:26.490 --> 00:22:32.470
While choosing two dreams,
futatsu no yume erabi

00:22:33.080 --> 00:22:39.950
And love taught me what it means...
soshite ai ga oshiete kureta yo ne

00:22:40.130 --> 00:22:46.810
to cherish someone.
hito wo omou imi

00:22:52.260 --> 00:22:54.850
I can save the Earth with my power?

00:22:54.930 --> 00:22:58.520
Fine. You can use my body as much as you like.

00:22:58.600 --> 00:23:01.530
However, Marlene is the only partner I will have!

00:23:01.600 --> 00:23:02.530
Yuji...

00:23:02.600 --> 00:23:04.570
That's my only condition!

00:23:04.640 --> 00:23:08.870
Make that known to the rest of my new team as well!

00:23:08.940 --> 00:23:12.670
But... this way of fighting... Don't tell me they're Sleepers too!
